    "description": "If you're a passionate Plant Manager with drive and ambition, Larsen & Toubro Consulting Pvt Ltd in Rajkot is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Larsen & Toubro Consulting Pvt Ltd:\nLarsen & Toubro Consulting Pvt Ltd is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Root Cause Analysis\n• Proficiency in PLC/SCADA\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n• Proficiency in ISO 9001\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Flexible working hours\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Rajkot, Gujarat, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Larsen & Toubro Consulting Pvt Ltd!",
